# Flutter UI

## Structure

- Pages: `presentation/pages/*_page.dart` — provide Cubit via `BlocProvider` + `sl<>()`.
- Feature widgets under `presentation/widgets/`.
- Prefer small private `StatelessWidget` classes over `Widget _build...` methods.
- Use `const` constructors where possible.

## Theming

- Tokens from Figma in `lib/config/theme/`: `AppColors` (Figma `--color-*`), `AppTextStyles` (Figma `heading/*`, `body/*`, `display`), `AppSpacing`, `AppRadius`, `AppShadows`, `AppDesign` (`app_dimens.dart`).
- Fonts: `InstrumentSans` (variable, weights 450/550 via `fontVariations`) and `InstrumentSerif` (display).
- Prefer `AppTextStyles.*` in custom widgets; `textTheme` slots are mapped in `AppTextTheme` for default widgets.
- Design is dark-only: `AppTheme.lightTheme` aliases `darkTheme`; default theme is dark.
- Never hardcode hex colors or font sizes. Follow `docs/ui/SLICING_RULES.md`.

## Responsive & assets

- `flutter_screenutil`: `.w`, `.h`, `.r`, `.sp`; `designSize` = Figma frame 440×956 (`AppDesign.frameSize`).
- Remote images: `CustomNetworkImage` / `cached_network_image` — always handle errors.
- Shared UI: `lib/shared/widgets/`; registry of Figma components in `docs/ui/COMPONENTS.md` (reuse first, register new ones).

## Localization

- Prefer `easy_localization` + generated `LocaleKeys` (`lib/generated/locale_keys.g.dart`) for new UI strings.
- Translation JSON: `assets/translations/en.json`, `ar.json`.
- Note: `home` still has a few hardcoded strings (`Loading products...`, `Retry`); do not copy that for new UI.

## State UI patterns (follow `home`)

- Loading: `LoadingWidget` (what `home` uses today). `ProductCardShimmer` exists but is unused — wire it only if you need card-shaped placeholders.
- Empty: `NoDataFoundWidget`.
- Error: inline message + Retry (not SnackBars by default).
- Lists: `ListView.builder` / grid builders; pull-to-refresh with `RefreshIndicator` where lists exist.

## Forms

- Set `textCapitalization`, `keyboardType`, `textInputAction` on `TextField`s.
